(7643818, 1242171, 3306, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. I find myself just staring at this wondering how you did it. A top contender for the Blue.</td>', 'Outstanding. I find myself just staring at this wondering how you did it. A top contender for the Blue.', '2019-10-16 10:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
