(7643821, 1242152, 3306, '<td valign="top">There seems to be no end to the creativity and abstract nature of forks photographically. I really like your composition. The lighting is outstanding and I really like the tonal contrast. One of my favorites.</td>', 'There seems to be no end to the creativity and abstract nature of forks photographically. I really like your composition. The lighting is outstanding and I really like the tonal contrast. One of my favorites.', '2019-10-16 10:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
