(7643853, 1242158, 159196, '<td valign="top">I never ever thought that I would get excited by a tap -  but this is reminiscent of Klimt and/or Wachtmeister and is very creative and worth taking one''s time to really look at it. It is so much more than just a tap - well done. For me, the frame doesn''t do it justice, but that''s just personal taste.</td>', 'I never ever thought that I would get excited by a tap -  but this is reminiscent of Klimt and/or Wachtmeister and is very creative and worth taking one''s time to really look at it. It is so much more than just a tap - well done. For me, the frame doesn''t do it justice, but that''s just personal taste.', '2019-10-16 16:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7644024, 1242090, 181505, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2019-10-18 21:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
