(7644159, 1241825, 50695, '<td valign="top">I think this is a more successful merge than the last one I commented on. by allowing her face to be transparent, you give the appearance of tears and scars of experience.</td>', 'I think this is a more successful merge than the last one I commented on. by allowing her face to be transparent, you give the appearance of tears and scars of experience.', '2019-10-21 13:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
