(7644161, 1242064, 50695, '<td valign="top">the interest in the photo is the real-life capture, so the filter only detracts from that by making it less real-life.</td>', 'the interest in the photo is the real-life capture, so the filter only detracts from that by making it less real-life.', '2019-10-21 13:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
