(7644378, 1241930, 124815, '<td valign="top">I had 5 images in this challenge that I liked and of course, this is one of them.<br/>It has humor, it has composition, it has an idea and this is the best quality of all.<br/>As to monitors and calibrating, there is no way that we can control how people see an image on their screens. There are too many variables. That''s why I insist that good images have to be printed. <br/>Make a book Roz.</td>', 'I had 5 images in this challenge that I liked and of course, this is one of them.It has humor, it has composition, it has an idea and this is the best quality of all.As to monitors and calibrating, there is no way that we can control how people see an image on their screens. There are too many variables. That''s why I insist that good images have to be printed. Make a book Roz.', '2019-10-22 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
